# The sneaked permanent attacks what the returned creature attacked, a battle too (CR 702.190b, 508.4a: a battle a defending
# player protects). Bot1 casts Invasion of Gobakhan on turn 1 and Bot2, its only opponent, protects it (CR 310.12a). On turn 3
# Ornithopter attacks the Siege, unblocked, and Bot1 casts Leonardo for his sneak cost {W}, returning the Ornithopter.
# Leonardo enters tapped and attacking the Siege: his 1 lifelink damage removes a defense counter (3 to 2, CR 120.3h) and
# gains Bot1 1 life, which puts a +1/+1 counter on him. Bot2 takes nothing.

